 fault! I didn't know the Sonny Bono Act was constitutional!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:0000039e:text","row":39295,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"「うわ～～～～～～んっ！！」","en":"“Waaaaaaaaah!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904008","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00013","en":"Miki: \"BWAAA～～～～～～HAAA!!!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:000003d2:text","row":39296,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"泣いてた。","en":"She was crying.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904009","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00014","en":"She was crying.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:000003fc:text","row":39297,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"「どしたっ！？」","en":"“What happened?!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904010","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00015","en":"Taichi: \"What is it?!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00000424:text","row":39298,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"胸に飛び込んできた。","en":"She threw herself into my arms.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904011","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00016","en":"She flew into my chest.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00000521:text","row":39299,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"受け止める。","en":"I caught her.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904012","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00017","en":"I catch her.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:0000056a:text","row":39300,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"「せんぱい、せんぱいせんぱいせんぱーーーーーいっ！！」","en":"“Taichi, Taichi, Taichi, Taiiiiiichiiii!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904013","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00018","en":"Miki: \"Senpai, SenpaiSenpaiSenpaaaaaai!!!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:000005b8:text","row":39301,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"泣きじゃくる。","en":"She sobbed.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904014","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00019","en":"Sobbing lament.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00000603:text","row":39302,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"「誰もいないよ～～～～～～っ！　おかしいよ～～～～～～っ、こんなの絶対おかしいよ～～～～～～っ！！」","en":"“There’s nobody anywhere! It’s not right! This can’t be right! It just can’t!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904015","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00020","en":"Miki: \"There's no ooo~ne! It's weee~~ird, this is totally weee~ird!!!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:0000067f:text","row":39303,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"弱っ！！","en":"So weak!","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904016","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00021","en":"Weak!!!","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:0000069f:text","row":39304,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"経験値がないってことなのかな？","en":"Was her EXP really that low?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904017","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00022","en":"Is this sort of like not having enough XP I wonder?","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:000006fa:text","row":39305,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"「どこの家にも誰もいないです！　ほんとに誰もいないんです、いなくなっちゃってます！！」","en":"“There’s nobody home anywhere! Nobody, really nobody—they’ve all disappeared!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904018","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00023","en":"Miki: \"There is no one inside anyone's house! There's really no one, they're all gone, all!!!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00000770:text","row":39306,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"「き、昨日の夜にわかってたことだろ？」","en":"“Y-you knew that last night, didn’t you?”","spea