Thank goodness you’re here...”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904024","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00029","en":"Miki: \"...sob, sob, yes... so happy... that you're here...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:000008fc:text","row":39312,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"ギャグだったんだが。","en":"I'd meant it as a joke.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904025","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00030","en":"But that was a joke.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:0000094d:text","row":39313,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"「朝おきて、お母さんとかいなくて、ごはんもなくて……そんでみんなまでいなくなってたらって考えたら……」","en":"“When I woke up, my mom wasn’t there, and there was no breakfast... and then I thought, what if everyone else was gone too...?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904026","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00031","en":"Miki: \"I woke up this morning, and mother wasn't there, and there wasn't to eat... and that's why I started thinking, what if everybody else is gone too, and...\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","omission"],"assessment":"The construction omits the required subject or object for the absence of food.","remedy":"there was nothing to eat","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":79,"start":60,"text":"there wasn't to eat"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:000009d3:text","row":39314,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"「恐くなっちゃったか」","en":"“That scared you, huh.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904027","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00032","en":"Taichi: \"And you got frightened?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00000a01:text","row":39315,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"額をすりつけるよう、こくこくと頷く。","en":"She rubbed her forehead against me as she nodded and nodded.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904028","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00033","en":"Bob bob, a steady nod that rubs her forehead on me.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00000a62:text","row":39316,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"「いやです、こんなの……わたし、いや……」","en":"“I hate this... I don’t want this...”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904029","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00034","en":"Miki: \"I don't like it, not this... I don't like it...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00000b75:text","row":39317,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"空を見上げる。","en":"I looked up at the sky.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904030","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00035","en":"I look up at the sky.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00000ba3:text","row":39318,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"「やっぱり人がいないと寂しいよな」","en":"“It gets lonely with no one else around, doesn’t it?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904031","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00036","en":"Taichi: \"Indeed it's lonely when people aren't there.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00000c02:text","row":39319,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"「……帰りたい……」","en":"“...I want to go home...”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904032","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00037","en":"Miki: \"...wanna go home...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00000c2e:text","row":39320,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"鋭いことを言う。","en":"That was perceptive.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904033","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00038","en":"She says something clever,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00000c56:text","row":39321,"ordinal":39,"kind":"text","jp":"ここが本来の世界ではないこと。","en":"This was not our original world.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904034","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00039","en":"that this is not our original world.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00000c8c:text","row":39322,"ordinal":40,"kind":"text","jp":"世界’であること。","en":"It was World Prime.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904035","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00040","en":"This here is World'.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00000cb6:text","row":39323,"ordinal":41,"kind":"text","jp":"美希の言葉は偶然だろうけど。","en":"Miki had only said it by chance.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904036","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00041","en":"Miki's words may have been coincidental, but,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00000cea:text","row":39324,"ordinal":42,"kind":"text","jp":"的を射ていた。","en":"But she'd hit the mark.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904037","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00042","en":"they hit the nail on the head.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00000de9:text","row":39325,"ordinal":43,"kind":"text","jp":"「帰りたいか……」","en":"“You want to go home...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904038","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00043","en":"Taichi: \"You wanna go home then...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00000e38:text","row":39326,"ordinal":44,"kind":"text","jp":"「帰りたい、帰りたい……」","en":"“I want to go home... I want to go home...”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904039","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00044","en":"Miki: \"Wanna go home, I wanna go home...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00000e72:text","row":39327,"ordinal":45,"kind":"text","jp":"「困ったなぁ、どうするかなぁ」","en":"“That's a problem. What am I going to do?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904040","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00045","en":"Taichi: \"What a problem, then, what do we do!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00000ea8:text","row":39328,"ordinal":46,"kind":"text","jp":"美希を慰める方法は、ある。","en":"I did know one way to comfort Miki.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904041","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00046","en":"There... is a method to console Miki.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00000eda:text","row":39329,"ordinal":47,"kind":"text","jp":"ちょっと卑怯な方法。","en":"A slightly dirty trick.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904042","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00047","en":"It's a somewhat cowardly method.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00000f06:text","row":39330,"ordinal":48,"kind":"text","jp":"似たもの同士の俺たちだから成立する手段。","en":"One that only worked because the two of us were so alike.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904043","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00048","en":"A method that exists because the two of us are fellows, similar in many ways.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00000f46:text","row":39331,"ordinal":49,"kind":"text","jp":"一週間限りだから。","en":"Because these versions of us had only one week.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904044","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00049","en":"Because the limit is one week,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00000f70:text","row":39332,"ordinal":50,"kind":"text","jp":"なんだってできる。","en":"That meant we could do anything.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904045","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00050","en":"anything and everything becomes possible.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00000f9f:text","row":39333,"ordinal":51,"kind":"text","jp":"人が一生を懸命に、後悔なく生きる様にも似て。","en":"Like living an entire life flat out, leaving no regrets.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904046","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00051","en":"People doing their absolute hardest in life live in ways that resemble having no regrets.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["logical_relation","grammar"],"assessment":"The Japanese likens their compressed week to the way people strive to live a whole lifetime without regret. The English makes people themselves resemble a state of having no regrets and obscures the comparison.","remedy":"Like people striving to live an entire lifetime without regrets.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":89,"start":0,"text":"People doing their absolute hardest in life live in ways that resemble having no regrets."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00000fe3:text","row":39334,"ordinal":52,"kind":"text","jp":"この一週間だけの固有の俺たちは、生き急がないといけない。","en":"The selves who existed only for this week had to live fast.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904047","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00052","en":"For those of us peculiar to this one single week, living without hurry is impermissible.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00001033:text","row":39335,"ordinal":53,"kind":"text","jp":"美希を誘う惹句(じゃっく)を、いくつか思い描いた瞬間。","en":"The moment several tempting come-ons for Miki flashed through my mind—","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904048","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00053","en":"The moment I envisioned several catchphrases with which to invite Miki,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:0000107f:text","row":39336,"ordinal":54,"kind":"text","jp":"蹴りが来た。","en":"A kick came flying.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904049","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00054","en":"a kick came.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00001270:text","row":39337,"ordinal":55,"kind":"text","jp":"「しゃーーーーーーーーーーっ！！」","en":"“Hyaaaaaaaaaah!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904050","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00055","en":"Kiri: \"Sh'yaaaaaaaaaa!!!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:000012b2:text","row":39338,"ordinal":56,"kind":"text","jp":"「がああっ！」","en":"“Gaaah!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904051","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00056","en":"Taichi: \"Ghaaah!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:000012d8:text","row":39339,"ordinal":57,"kind":"text","jp":"霧のキックが、俺を美希からむしりとった。","en":"Kiri’s kick tore me away from Miki.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904052","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00057","en":"Kiri's kick plucked me off Miki.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:0000140a:text","row":39340,"ordinal":58,"kind":"text","jp":"「なにさらすねん！」","en":"“What the fuck was that?!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904053","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00058","en":"Taichi: \"Whass'at ya doin'!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:000014ba:text","row":39341,"ordinal":59,"kind":"text","jp":"「痴漢行為はやめてください！」","en":"“Stop groping her!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904054","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00059","en":"Kiri: \"Please cease these acts of molestation!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:000014f8:text","row":39342,"ordinal":60,"kind":"text","jp":"「痴漢じゃない！」","en":"“I wasn't groping her!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904055","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00060","en":"Taichi: \"I'm not molester!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar"],"assessment":"The singular count noun requires an article.","remedy":"I'm not a molester!","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":26,"start":9,"text":"I'm not molester!"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:000015a6:text","row":39343,"ordinal":61,"kind":"text","jp":"「痴漢１００％です」","en":"“One hundred percent groping.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904056","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00061","en":"Kiri: \"You are 100% a molester.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:000015da:text","row":39344,"ordinal":62,"kind":"text","jp":"「痴漢じゃないって！」","en":"“I'm telling you, I wasn't!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904057","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00062","en":"Taichi: \"Told you I'm not a molester!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:000016e4:text","row":39345,"ordinal":63,"kind":"text","jp":"「ほああ、霧ちん……」","en":"“Ohhh, Kiri-kins...”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904058","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00063","en":"Miki: \"Bwahhh, Kiri-chin...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00001712:text","row":39346,"ordinal":64,"kind":"text","jp":"美希がふんにゃりした。","en":"Miki melted.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904059","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00064","en":"Miki was enervated,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00001740:text","row":39347,"ordinal":65,"kind":"text","jp":"そして霧に抱きつく。","en":"Then wrapped her arms around Kiri.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904060","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00065","en":"and then went to hug Kiri.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00001791:text","row":39348,"ordinal":66,"kind":"text","jp":"「ふぇぇぇぇ～～～～～～んっ！」","en":"“Waaaaaaaaah!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904061","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00066","en":"Miki: \"Bwheee～～～～～～h!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:0000184d:text","row":39349,"ordinal":67,"kind":"text","jp":"「平気、もう平気だから」","en":"“It's okay. You're safe now.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904062","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00067","en":"Kiri: \"It's alright, it's alright now.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:0000187d:text","row":39350,"ordinal":68,"kind":"text","jp":"あれ？","en":"Huh?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904063","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00068","en":"What?","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:000018a3:text","row":39351,"ordinal":69,"kind":"text","jp":"「美希や……俺の無実を証明してはくれないのかい？」","en":"“Miki, dear... Would you care to testify to my innocence?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904064","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00069","en":"Taichi: \"So Miki... you're not going to prove my innocence at all?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00001912:text","row":39352,"ordinal":70,"kind":"text","jp":"「えぐっ、ひくっ、うっく」","en":"“Sob... hic... ngh...”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904065","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00070","en":"Miki: \"Sob, hyKh, uHkh.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00001944:text","row":39353,"ordinal":71,"kind":"text","jp":"泣きじゃくっている。","en":"She was still sobbing.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904066","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00071","en":"She was sobbing,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:000019d1:text","row":39354,"ordinal":72,"kind":"text","jp":"かわりに、霧がキッと俺を睨む。","en":"Kiri answered for her with a glare.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904067","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00072","en":"whereas Kiri is sharply glaring at me.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00001a2a:text","row":39355,"ordinal":73,"kind":"text","jp":"「……許さない」","en":"“...I won't forgive you.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904068","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00073","en":"Kiri: \"...inexcusable.\"","verdict":"questionable","categories":["register_voice","mistranslation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00001a75:text","row":39356,"ordinal":74,"kind":"text","jp":"「痴漢は絶対に許さない！」","en":"“I will never forgive a groper!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904069","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00074","en":"Kiri: \"Molesting is absolutely inexcusable!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00001aaf:text","row":39357,"ordinal":75,"kind":"text","jp":"「違うがな！」","en":"“That's not what happened!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904070","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00075","en":"Taichi: \"Ya got it wrong!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00001b59:text","row":39358,"ordinal":76,"kind":"text","jp":"「美希が泣いてるのが、証拠です」","en":"“Miki is crying. That is proof.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904071","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00076","en":"Kiri: \"Miki is crying, that is proof!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00001b99:text","row":39359,"ordinal":77,"kind":"text","jp":"「ぉぃぉぃぉぃぉぃ」","en":"“Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904072","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00077","en":"Taichi: \"(well, well, well, well.)\"","verdict":"questionable","categories":["register_voice","idiom_calque"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00001bc5:text","row":39360,"ordinal":78,"kind":"text","jp":"冗談じゃないぞ。","en":"This was no joke.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904073","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0006:00078","en":"This ain't a joke now!","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0292:00001bed:text","row":39361,"ordinal":79,"